<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE concept PUBLIC "-//OASIS//DTD DITA 1.3 Concept//EN" "concept.dtd">
<concept base="Anywhere" deliveryTarget="except_print" id="t00281">
	<title>Charging and climate</title>
	<prolog>
		<metadata>
			<keywords>
				<indexterm>charging and climate</indexterm>
			</keywords>
		</metadata>
	</prolog>
	<conbody>
		<table colsep="1" frame="none" outputclass="formatc_none" rowsep="1">
			<tgroup cols="2" colsep="0" rowsep="1">
				<colspec colname="col1" colnum="1" colsep="0" colwidth="50*"/>
				<colspec colname="col2" colnum="2" colsep="0" colwidth="50*"/>
				<tbody>
					<row rowsep="1">
						<entry colname="col1">
							<fig>
								<figgroup>
									<image align="center" href="../../images/N_CT25Q015_E.eps" scale="95" placement="break"/>
								</figgroup>
							</fig>
						</entry>
						<entry colname="col2">
							<p>Select the icon from the infotainment system screen and Scheduled charging and target temperature.</p>
						</entry>
					</row>
				</tbody>
			</tgroup>
		</table>
		<note type="note">
			<p>Vehicle must be connected with the charging connector at the time pre-scheduled time for the scheduled charging.</p>
		</note>
		<table colsep="1" frame="none" outputclass="formatc_none" rowsep="1">
			<tgroup cols="2" colsep="0" rowsep="1">
				<colspec colname="col1" colnum="1" colsep="0" colwidth="50*"/>
				<colspec colname="col2" colnum="2" colsep="0" colwidth="50*"/>
				<tbody>
					<row rowsep="1">
						<entry colname="col1">
							<fig>
								<figgroup>
									<image align="center" href="../../images/N_CT25Q013_E.eps" scale="95" placement="break"/>
								</figgroup>
							</fig>
						</entry>
						<entry colname="col2">
							<p>You can set the date and time of when to charge the battery and the climate control temperature. Also, you may select the time to start charging using the Off-peak time settings.</p>
						</entry>
					</row>
				</tbody>
			</tgroup>
		</table>
	</conbody>
</concept>